# Generate auto table fill methods
Implement a method to copy parameters from the populated csv file 'Species_params_GEMINI_populated.csv' into a pre-existing table in word in the file Species_params_word_table.docx. Specifically, match the species to the columns in that table, specifically under the column 'Start'. The rows represent different parameters to be populated and are grouped according to sub-headings. One the table is populated, insert all the references you have collected alphabetically by first authors last name after the table. in the table, for every parameter entered, link to the specific reference by inserting a number in superscript which maps to the list of references as footnotes to the table. in the table the references should appear in numeric order based on the row and column of the table. 